  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2006.04 Renewal of Repairer Registration. All repairer registrations shall expire biennially on March 31st and renewed in accordance with the requirements of Saf-C 2003.11(b).\n\nSource. #6663, eff 1-1-98 (from Saf-C 2005), EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #8569, INTERIM, eff 2-18-06, EXPIRED: 8-17-06\n\nNew. #8966, eff 8-23-07; ss by #11028, eff 1-29-16",
